meta {
  name: tag: gatus (tapis)
  type: http
  seq: 19
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/pods/templates/gatus/tags
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  X-Tapis-Token: {{X-Tapis-Token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "kind": "pod",
    "pod_definition": {
      "image": "twinproduction/gatus:v5.36.0",
      "description": "Full Tapis status board - rendered from tapis/status-config-builder for one tenant (Systems, Apps, Jobs, Notifications, Files, Meta, SK, Tenants, Tokens, Streams, Actors, Pods, GlobusProxy, Workflows, Authenticator). All per-tenant values (base_url, jwt, display, intervals, authn creds) are secret_map placeholders filled at instantiation. SQLite storage at /data (mount the tapisvolume below).",
      "time_to_stop_default": -1,
      "secret_map": {
        "BASE_URL": "${:?Tapis tenant base URL used for every request, e.g. https://tacc.tapis.io}",
        "DISPLAY": "${pods:default:Tapis:?Tenant label appended to each check name, e.g. TACC}",
        "JWT": "${:?Valid USER JWT (NOT a service account) for the auth-required list checks}",
        "HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL": "${pods:default:15s:?How often to poll /healthcheck endpoints (default 15s)}",
        "SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL": "${pods:default:60s:?How often to poll auth-required service/list endpoints (default 60s)}",
        "AUTHN_USERNAME": "${:?Username for the Authenticator token-create check (NOT a service account)}",
        "AUTHN_PASSWORD": "${:?Password for AUTHN_USERNAME}"
      },
      "volume_mounts": {
        "/config/config.yaml": {
          "type": "ephemeral",
          "read_only": false,
          "config_content": "# Tapis status board - rendered from tapis/status-config-builder for ONE tenant.\n# ${pods:secrets:KEY} placeholders are filled by the Pods service from secret_map at instantiation.\nstorage:\n  type: sqlite\n  path: /data/data.db\n\nweb:\n  port: 8080\n\nui:\n  title: Tapis Status | ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n  header: Tapis Service Status\n\nendpoints:\n  - name: Systems HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/systems/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Systems\n  - name: Systems List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/systems\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Systems\n  - name: Apps HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/apps/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Apps\n  - name: Apps List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/apps\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Apps\n  - name: Jobs HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/jobs/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Jobs\n  - name: Jobs List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/jobs/list\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Jobs\n  - name: Notifications HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/notifications/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Notifications\n  - name: Notifications Subscriptions List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/notifications/subscriptions\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Notifications\n  - name: Files HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/files/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Files\n  - name: Meta HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/meta/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Meta\n  - name: SK HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/security/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Security Kernel\n  - name: Tenants List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Tenants\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/tenants\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Tokens Ready ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Tokens\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/tokens/ready\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Streams Ready ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Streams\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/streams/ready\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Actors List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Actors\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/actors\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Pods List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Pods\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/pods\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: GlobusProxy HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: GlobusProxy\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/globus-proxy/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Workflows HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/workflows/healthcheck\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n    group: Workflows\n  - name: Workflows Groups List ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Workflows\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/workflows/groups\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    headers:\n      X-Tapis-Token: ${pods:secrets:JWT}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Authenticator HealthCheck ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Authenticator\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/oauth2/hello\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL}\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n  - name: Authenticator Tokens Create ${pods:secrets:DISPLAY}\n    group: Authenticator\n    url: ${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/oauth2/tokens\n    interval: ${pods:secrets:SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL}\n    method: POST\n    headers:\n      Content-type: application/json\n    body: '{\"username\": \"${pods:secrets:AUTHN_USERNAME}\", \"password\": \"${pods:secrets:AUTHN_PASSWORD}\", \"grant_type\": \"password\"}'\n    conditions:\n      - \"[STATUS] == 200\"\n",
          "config_permissions": "0644",
          "config_filename": "config.yaml",
          "config_update_mode": "always"
        },
        "/data": {
          "type": "tapisvolume",
          "source_id": "${:?Tapis volume for the gatus SQLite history (mounted at /data) - REQUIRED because the scratch image has no writable dir for sqlite}"
        }
      },
      "networking": {
        "default": {
          "protocol": "http",
          "port": 8080,
          "tapis_auth": true,
          "tapis_auth_allowed_users": [
            "*"
          ],
          "tapis_auth_return_path": "/",
          "tapis_ui_uri_redirect": true,
          "tapis_ui_uri_description": "Gatus - full Tapis service status board"
        }
      },
      "healthchecks": {
        "readiness": {
          "http_get_path": "/health",
          "http_get_port": 8080,
          "initial_delay_seconds": 5,
          "period_seconds": 10
        },
        "liveness": {
          "http_get_path": "/health",
          "http_get_port": 8080,
          "initial_delay_seconds": 30,
          "period_seconds": 15
        },
        "networking_requires_ready": true
      },
      "resources": {
        "cpu_request": 100,
        "cpu_limit": 1000,
        "mem_request": 128,
        "mem_limit": 1024
      }
    },
    "tag": "tapis",
    "commit_message": "Full Tapis status board (status-config-builder rendered, 21 endpoints across 15 services). Per-tenant base_url/jwt/display/intervals/authn as secret_map placeholders; SQLite on a /data tapisvolume. Fixed the interal->interval typos."
  }
}

docs {
  ## Gatus - full Tapis status board (per-tenant, placeholdered)
  
  Rendered from the official `tapis/status-config-builder` Jinja for **one tenant**, with every
  `{{ tenant.* }}` turned into a Pods `secret_map` placeholder. 21 checks across 15 services:
  Systems, Apps, Jobs, Notifications, Files, Meta, Security Kernel, Tenants, Tokens, Streams,
  Actors, Pods, GlobusProxy, Workflows, Authenticator.
  
  ### Fill these at instantiation (secret_map)
  | key | required | what |
  |-----|----------|------|
  | `BASE_URL` | yes | tenant base, e.g. `https://tacc.tapis.io` |
  | `JWT` | yes | a **user** JWT (not a service account) for the auth-required list checks |
  | `AUTHN_USERNAME` / `AUTHN_PASSWORD` | yes | user creds for the Authenticator token-create check |
  | `DISPLAY` | default `Tapis` | label appended to each check name |
  | `HEALTHCHECK_INTERVAL` | default `15s` | poll rate for `/healthcheck` |
  | `SERVICECHECK_INTERVAL` | default `60s` | poll rate for auth-required list endpoints |
  
  The Pods service interpolates `${pods:secrets:KEY}` into the config **before mount** (inline, so
  `${pods:secrets:BASE_URL}/v3/systems/healthcheck` resolves fine). That's why it's secret_map and
  not env vars - one fill, baked into the YAML.
  
  ### Storage: SQLite on a volume (your choice)
  You asked for `storage.type: sqlite` at `/data/data.db`. The `twinproduction/gatus` image is
  `FROM scratch` (no writable dir), so a `tapisvolume` is **mounted at `/data`** - it both provides
  the writable dir (no `SQLITE_CANTOPEN`) and persists history across restarts. You must pass a
  Tapis volume id at instantiation.
  
  ### Heads-up on the JWT
  The auth checks send `X-Tapis-Token: <JWT>`; when that JWT **expires** those checks flip red
  (401) even if the service is healthy. That's inherent to the status-config-builder approach -
  rotate the secret, or drop the list checks and keep only the public `/healthcheck` ones.
  
  ### Instantiate
  `POST /pods` with `{ "template": "gatus:tapis", "pod_id": "tapisstatus", "template_overrides":
  { "secret_map": { "BASE_URL": "https://tacc.tapis.io", "JWT": "...", ... },
  "volume_mounts": { "/data": { "source_id": "your-volume" } } } }`.
}
